[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="InventoryItemDefinition" format=3 uid="uid://baopg28dt8iet"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/data/inventory_item_definition.gd" id="1_definition"]
[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://dy1gfjjj466vx" path="res://scripts/data/gate_condition.gd" id="2_condition"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/data/inventory_item_state.gd" id="3_state"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="GateCondition_has_field_book"]
script = ExtResource("2_condition")
all_of = Array[StringName]([&"has_field_book"])

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="InventoryItemState_field_book"]
script = ExtResource("3_state")
condition = SubResource("GateCondition_has_field_book")
label = "Field Book"
description = "Theo's Ghostbusters field book."
action_input = &"open_field_book"
action_key_hint = "Q"
action_kind = &"book"
book_title = "Theo's Field Book"
book_pages = Array[String](["[b]Theo's Ghostbusters Field Book[/b]

Property of Theo. If found, please return — there are notes in here I can't afford to lose.

The goal of this book is simple: catalogue every odd thing I see in this town and figure out which ones are actually ghosts.", "[b]Rule 1.[/b] If it makes the air cold, write it down.
[b]Rule 2.[/b] If it makes the dog bark at nothing, write it down.
[b]Rule 3.[/b] If it makes a grown-up suddenly change the subject, definitely write it down.", "[b]Suspects so far[/b]

• The lighthouse keeper — always near the bluffs after dark.
• The librarian — knows more about the old town hall fire than she lets on.
• That guy at the diner — claims he hears footsteps upstairs every night.", "[b]Field notes[/b]

The attic at the boarding house felt twelve degrees colder than the hallway. My pocket watch stopped at 3:11 AM exactly.

If I see 3:11 one more time I'm going to lose it.", "[b]Equipment checklist[/b]

— Flashlight (working)
— Notebook (this one)
— Salt packet from the diner
— Half a chocolate bar (emergency rations)
— Courage (intermittent)", "[b]Reminders[/b]

Ask Fred about the symbol on the cellar door.
Check the church bell rope — someone's been ringing it at odd hours.
Do NOT go back to the bluffs alone."])

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_definition")
item_id = &"theo_field_book"
states = [SubResource("InventoryItemState_field_book")]
